# DEEH v0.1 — Dynamic Epistemic Event Horizon
LANGUAGE DEEH SURFACES canonical,user-native BACKENDS object,bytecode,ir-json,human

TYPE EventHorizonState BASE Value
TYPE RawSubject BASE Value
TYPE KnownStructure BASE Value
TYPE GeometryCarrier BASE Value
TYPE TopologyCarrier BASE Value
TYPE OtherCarrier BASE Value
TYPE HorizonWitness BASE Value
TYPE Remainder BASE Value
TYPE ECSFrontier BASE Value

PRESERVE RawSubjectIdentity
PRESERVE Provenance
PRESERVE EvidenceClaimCeiling
PRESERVE FailureHistory
PRESERVE ContradictionHistory
PRESERVE UnresolvedRemainder
PRESERVE GeometryTopologyDistinction
PRESERVE SharedMethodEvidenceDistinction
PRESERVE HorizonMovementWitness

CONTEXT DEEH role="pre-carrier epistemic extraction" version="0.1.0" authority="none"
CONTEXT DEEH_SOII seam="decision_field.event_horizon" schema_change="none"
CONTEXT DEEH_ECS relation="remainder_to_frontier" evidence_transfer="deny"

RELATION DEEHCarries ALLOW EventHorizonState KnownStructure DENY truth_promotion
RELATION DEEHProjectsGeometry ALLOW EventHorizonState GeometryCarrier DENY carrier_exhaustiveness
RELATION DEEHProjectsTopology ALLOW EventHorizonState TopologyCarrier DENY carrier_exhaustiveness
RELATION DEEHProjectsOther ALLOW EventHorizonState OtherCarrier DENY carrier_exhaustiveness
RELATION DEEHFeedsECS ALLOW Remainder ECSFrontier DENY cross_domain_evidence_transfer

OPERATOR HorizonIngest BIND EventHorizonState INPUT RawSubject OUTPUT EventHorizonState EFFECT observe AUTHORITY none PRESERVE raw_hash provenance
OPERATOR HorizonObserve BIND EventHorizonState INPUT EventHorizonState OUTPUT EventHorizonState EFFECT observe AUTHORITY none PRESERVE raw_hash provenance
OPERATOR HorizonExtract BIND KnownStructure INPUT EventHorizonState OUTPUT KnownStructure EFFECT analyze AUTHORITY none PRESERVE evidence claim_ceiling
OPERATOR HorizonClassify BIND KnownStructure INPUT KnownStructure OUTPUT KnownStructure EFFECT representation AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance
OPERATOR HorizonRotate BIND KnownStructure INPUT KnownStructure OUTPUT KnownStructure EFFECT representation AUTHORITY none PRESERVE invariants provenance
OPERATOR HorizonCounterprobe BIND HorizonWitness INPUT KnownStructure OUTPUT HorizonWitness EFFECT verify AUTHORITY none PRESERVE failures contradictions
OPERATOR HorizonCloseKnown BIND EventHorizonState INPUT EventHorizonState OUTPUT EventHorizonState EFFECT analyze AUTHORITY none PRESERVE failures remainder evidence
OPERATOR HorizonComputeRemainder BIND Remainder INPUT EventHorizonState OUTPUT Remainder EFFECT analyze AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance failures
OPERATOR HorizonSelectProbe BIND HorizonWitness INPUT Remainder OUTPUT HorizonWitness EFFECT route AUTHORITY none PRESERVE cost independence discrimination
OPERATOR HorizonMove BIND EventHorizonState INPUT EventHorizonState HorizonWitness OUTPUT EventHorizonState EFFECT repair AUTHORITY none PRESERVE closure_history provenance
OPERATOR HorizonToECS BIND ECSFrontier INPUT Remainder OUTPUT ECSFrontier EFFECT route AUTHORITY none PRESERVE claim_ceiling provenance
OPERATOR HorizonRollback BIND EventHorizonState INPUT EventHorizonState OUTPUT EventHorizonState EFFECT repair AUTHORITY none PRESERVE history provenance

RULE DEEH_R01 IF "raw subject is ingested" THEN "freeze raw identity before interpretation"
RULE DEEH_R02 IF "structure has no evidence witness" THEN "do not promote it into known"
RULE DEEH_R03 IF "geometry fit fails" THEN "retain topology and other-carrier possibilities"
RULE DEEH_R04 IF "topology fit fails" THEN "retain geometry and other-carrier possibilities"
RULE DEEH_R05 IF "geometry and topology both fail" THEN "open candidate new carrier instead of forcing a fit"
RULE DEEH_R06 IF "current closure reaches fixed point" THEN "label remainder relative to current operator set"
RULE DEEH_R07 IF "horizon would move" THEN "require explicit evidence witness and preserve closure event"
RULE DEEH_R08 IF "ECS is invoked" THEN "route consequential remainder rather than overwrite raw subject"
RULE DEEH_R09 IF "Dynamic Fitter reorganizes state" THEN "forbid silent horizon movement or evidence promotion"
RULE DEEH_R10 IF "two carriers preserve the same invariant" THEN "do not infer shared evidence authority"

CLAIM DEEH_C01 STATUS BOUNDED_CLAIM TEXT "DEEH is a pre-carrier evidence-bounded closure and moving-frontier layer that exposes known structure before geometry/topology commitment and routes only the consequential remainder to ECS."
COUNTERPROBE "Find a consequential distinction destroyed by closure, a horizon movement without witness, or a carrier-fit failure incorrectly treated as absence of structure."
VERIFY "RAW != KNOWN != UNKNOWN; NO_GEOMETRIC_FIT != NO_STRUCTURE; HORIZON_MOVEMENT requires witness."